@HostAddress = http://localhost:5206
### Products - Get 100 
### /api/products?pageNumber=1&pageSize=100&search=&categoryId=&minPrice=  ###
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Products?pageNumber=1&pageSize=100
###
GET  {{HostAddress}}/api/Products


### Products - Get by id
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Products/8

### Products - Create
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop overpriced",
  "price": 999.9999,
  "stock": 25,
  "createdAt": "2026-09-01T10:00:00",
  "categoryId": 8
}

### Products - Update
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/Products/50
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Pro",
  "price": 1299.99,
  "stock": 15,
  "createdAt": "2026-09-01T10:00:00",
  "categoryId": 8
}

### Products - Delete
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/Products/9

### Categories - Get all
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Categories

### Categories - Get by id
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Categories/8

### Categories - Get products by category
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Categories/8/products

### Categories - Create
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New digital books",
  "description": " difital books licensea and ebooks"
}

### Categories - Update
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/Categories/9
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated digital books",
  "description": "Updated digital books and ebooks"
}

### Categories - Delete
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/Categories/9

### Reports - Get Inventory Value
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Reports/inventory-value
### Reports - Get Most Expensive Product
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Reports/most-expensive
### out of stock products
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Reports/out-of-stock
### Category stats 
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Reports/category-stats